  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Confidential Soft is the softer, more plush evolution of Confidential and part of the Prizm Project. Finished in an electric pink colorway, it preserves the directional control, feel, spin and reliable playability of the original while adding greater comfort and more pop for easier depth and pace. The 1.25 mm version offers the most balanced performance, while thinner gauges emphasize feel and response and the 1.30 mm version provides increased durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Solinco Confidential Soft 是 Confidential 的更柔和、更 Plush 的版本，同时属于 Prizm Project 系列，并采用 Electric Pink 电光粉配色。它保留标准 Confidential 标志性的方向控制、手感、旋转以及稳定可打性，同时加入更高舒适度和更明显的 Pop，让球员更容易获得击球深度和速度。1.25 毫米版本综合表现最均衡；较细线径更强调手感与响应；1.30 毫米版本则更偏向耐久和稳定。"
  },

